{"duration": 50.049, "exact_word_timing": true, "lines": [{"beat": 0, "text": "A shipyard foreman hoists a massive wooden lifeboat onto a crane, sweat dripping.", "start": 0.08, "end": 4.179}, {"beat": 1, "text": "The crew laughs, saying \u201cWe have enough \u2013 the law only asks for this many.\u201d", "start": 4.599, "end": 8.15}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Titanic rolls out of Belfast with twenty boats, but only sixteen can be launched from the davits.", "start": 8.57, "end": 13.522}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Two emergency cutters sit hanging, ready, while four collapsibles are stored upside\u2011down on the officers\u2019 roof.", "start": 13.742, "end": 19.665}, {"beat": 3, "text": "You see, it\u2019s like packing a school bus with only a few seat belts \u2013 you feel unsafe even before an accident.", "start": 20.085, "end": 25.697}, {"beat": 4, "text": "The Board of Trade required ships over ten\u2011thousand tons to carry just sixteen lifeboats for 990 people.", "start": 26.117, "end": 32.731}, {"beat": 4, "text": "White Star chose to exceed that rule, fitting twenty boats that could hold 1,178 souls \u2013 still only a third of the 2,200 aboard.", "start": 32.951, "end": 42.161}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Because the law was so lax, the \u201cextra\u201d boats were never fully integrated, leaving half the ship without a quick escape route.", "start": 42.581, "end": 48.929}], "words": [{"w": "A", "start": 0.145, "end": 0.195, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "shipyard", "start": 0.27, "end": 0.62, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "foreman", "start": 0.67, "end": 0.995, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "hoists", "start": 1.045, "end": 1.345, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "a", "start": 1.37, "end": 1.42, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "massive", "start": 1.495, "end": 1.87, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "wooden", "start": 1.92, "end": 2.12, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "lifeboat", "start": 2.17, "end": 2.62, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "onto", "start": 2.67, "end": 2.845, "line": 0, "beat